            <ArticleTitle>[Posttraumatic right sided diaphragmal hernia].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>499-502</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This case report demonstrates a post-traumatic right sided diaphragmal hernia presenting 17 years after trauma with acute abdominal pain. An incarcerated duodenal bowel loop was radiologically suspected and confirmed by subsequent surgery.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
